  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Markets for Sanitation Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall purpose of this Activity is to increase gender inclusive and equitable access to, and use of, improved sanitation and hygiene products and services. The Activity will work to fulfill this purpose through four complementary intermediate results: 1. Gender inclusive sanitation and hygiene sector governance strengthened; 2. Increased demand for gender inclusive basic sanitation and hygiene products, services, and behaviors; 3. Increased equitable supply of diverse and affordable basic sanitation and hygiene products; and 4. Improved coordination and learning among sanitation and hygiene actors including the private sector.</narrative>
  </description>
